    "legal_notice": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Copyright notice</h2>In Pixel Art Academy, I display other copyrighted works for their historical significance and educational value. I do this under fair use, however, it is not my desire to display the works of authors who do not want to be included in the game. If you want any of your works removed, contact me and I will remove them as soon as possible.<br> <br>Credits in screenshots and trailers: Macintosh 128k, Apple Computer, 1984; Keu (NYKRA), ENDESGA, 2015; Disenfranchised frog (Despot Dungeons), Hjalte Tagmose, 2017; Space Invaders, Taito, 1978; Brush, Susan Kare, 1982; PAC-MAN, Namco, 1980; Madeline (Celeste Classic), Noel Berry, 2015; PICO-8, Lexaloffle Games, 2015; Gomez (FEZ), Phil Fish, 2009; Into The Breach, Justin Ma, 2017; Otus (Owlboy), Simon Stafsnes 'Snake' Andersen, 2008; 720\u00b0 (ZX Spectrum), Atari, 1987; Sheep Lad, Robin Poe, WIP; Arclands, Jon Keller, WIP; Die in the Dungeon, \u00c1lvaro Farf\u00e1n, WIP; Mickey Mouse Sound Cartoon, Ub Iwerks, 1928; Zaxxon SEGA, 1982. All rights belong to their respective owners.",
